Implementation provenance
-------------------------
This is an Erlang implementation written for Zotonic from the W3C format
specifications. It is not a port or direct transliteration of an Elixir or
Java implementation. No implementation source from the reference projects
listed below is included.

Specification and behavioral references:
- W3C RDF 1.1 Turtle: https://www.w3.org/TR/turtle/
- Apache Jena (Java): https://jena.apache.org/documentation/io/
- RDF.ex (Elixir): https://github.com/rdf-elixir/rdf-ex

Third-party test data
---------------------
The files in test/data/w3c-turtle are copied from the W3C RDF 1.1 Turtle
suite, not from the reference implementations above. Their original copyright
notices, manifest and dual W3C Test Suite / W3C 3-clause BSD licensing are
retained. See that directory's SOURCE.md, LICENSE.md and LICENSE-W3C-BSD.txt.
These fixtures are not relicensed under Apache-2.0.

The BSD option is used here for development and regression testing. The local
runner is not an authoritative W3C conformance suite and does not imply W3C
endorsement. Both license texts and pinned upstream provenance are included
with the fixtures. Preserve these notices when redistributing that data.
